      "payload": {
        "kind": "agentTurn",
        "message": "Execute Jesse knowledgebase hourly closed-loop using git-only flow (no gh dependency).\n\nRepository:\n- path: C:/Users/RainH/.openclaw/shared/agent-knowledge-layer\n- remote: origin\n- working branch: agent/jesse\n- protected target: main (never direct commits/pushes to main)\n\nSteps:\n1) git -C <path> fetch origin\n2) git -C <path> checkout agent/jesse\n3) sync main into personal branch (prefer rebase):\n   - git -C <path> rebase origin/main\n   - fallback: merge origin/main into agent/jesse if policy requires\n4) commit and push latest personal branch changes if any:\n   - git add/commit as needed\n   - git -C <path> push origin agent/jesse\n5) detect effective change vs main:\n   - if `git -C <path> rev-list --count origin/main..agent/jesse` > 0, set no-changes=false and output PR compare URL for manual/automated PR create/update:\n     https://github.com/reed1898/agent-knowledge-layer/compare/main...agent/jesse?expand=1\n   - else set no-changes=true\n\nOutput requirement:\n- concise status: sync result, push result, no-changes flag, and compare URL when changes exist\n- if failed: transparent failure format (blocker / cause / next step)."
      },
